 to the center of the Senate chamber holding up a phone.",0,""],["w",0.7],["clear",0,0,1],["objx"],["w",0.4],["stg",0,90.0,null,null,"OutCubic",0.8,null,null,null],["show","avg3_122","a","002",0.1,-0.03,1.05,0,null,0.0],["ctl","avg3_122","a",null,null,0.25,null,null,1.0,null,"OutCubic",0.75],["w",0.15],["se","se_342"],["bg","dulcia_office_inside",2,0.0],["cbg",2,0.0,0.0,1.05,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["stage",2,0,0],["bgm","m46"],["show","avg3_215","a","003",0.8,-0.09,1.15,2,null,0.0],["ctl","avg3_215","a",null,null,0.5,null,null,1.0,null,"OutBack",0.7],["w",0.5],["obj","qstory_main_07_005",1,null,0.54],["w",0.2],["say","avg3_215","I will repeat myself.==W== I am vetoing this resolution.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_215","a","002","shock",null,null,null,null,"jushou","OutSine",0.35],["w",0.35],["goon"],["w",0.4],["ctl","avg3_215","a",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.3],["ctl","avg3_122","a",null,"exclamation",null,null,null,null,"jushou","OutSine",0.3],["w",0.3],["say","Excited Senator","Don't panic. The voice is coming from the Trekker's phone. It might be a recording.",0,""],["w",0.35],["ctl","avg3_215","a",null,"angry",null,null,null,null,"lengzhan","OutSine",0.35],["w",0.35],["say","avg3_215","Who is whispering? Do you think this is pre-recorded? Is that you, Obart?",0,""],["ctl","avg3_215","a",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,"OutSine",0.35],["w",0.35],["ctl","avg3_122","a",null,"vexation",null,null,null,null,"ChanDou","OutSine",0.35],["w",0.35],["say","Obart","Ahem! Grand Inspector, surely you didn't crash the Senate in this fashion solely to use your veto?",0,""],["w",0.35],["ctl","avg3_215","a","011","question",null,null,null,null,null,"OutSine",0.3],["say","avg3_215","My veto power is explicitly written in the company charter. Do you have a problem with that?",0,""],["w",0.35],["ctl","avg3_122","a",null,"flurry",null,null,null,null,"daintou","Linear",0.35],["w",0.35],["say","Obart","O-Of course not.",0,""],["objx"],["w",0.35],["stage",2,1,1],["w",0.6],["show","avg3_145","a","005",0.73,-0.05,1.07,0,null,0.0],["ctl","avg3_145","a",null,"sweaty",0.63,null,null,1.0,null,"OutCubic",0.5],["w",0.5],["say","Cautious Senator","I checked my device. Inter-city comms in New Orelian are still blocked. Which means...",0,""],["w",0.35],["stg",0,null,-20.0,1.1,"OutCubic",0.6,null,null,null],["ctl","avg3_122","a",null,"speechless",0.32,null,null,null,null,"OutCubic",0.6],["ctl","avg3_145","a",null,null,0.56,null,null,null,null,"OutCubic",0.6],["w",0.6],["say","Obart","She's already back within the New Orelian Monolith's coverage? How did she return from Port Goldfinch...",0,""],["ctl","avg3_122","a",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,"OutSine",0.35],["w",0.35],["ctl","avg3_122","a",null,"symbol",null,null,null,null,"jushou","OutSine",0.35],["w",0.35],["say","Obart","Wait. What if she never left New Orelian? What if this was a trap to lure us out?",0,""],["w",0.35],["ctl","avg3_145","a","008","awkward",null,null,null,null,"lengzhan","OutSine",0.35],["w",0.35],["say","Cautious Senator","Then her real goal is...==W== Yes, that's it! She plans to raid our offices while we are stuck in this meeting!",0,""],["w",0.6],["ctl","avg3_145","a","007","idea",null,null,null,null,"jushou","OutSine",0.3],["w",0.3],["goon"],["w",0.35],["ctl","avg3_122","a",null,"exclamation",null,null,null,null,"jushou","OutSine",0.3],["w",0.3],["bgm",""],["say","Obart","Damn it... Forget the motion! We need to head back now!",0,""],["w",0.35],["se","se_076"],["trn",0,3,true,true,1.0],["w",1.0],["bg","dulcia_office_inside",0,0.0],["cbg",0,null,null,1.05,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["stg",0,0.0,0.0,1.0,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["w",0.4],["trn",1,3,false,false,1.0],["stg",0,null,null,1.1,"OutSine",2.9,null,null,null],["w",0.1],["show","avg3_215","a","004",null,-0.09,1.15,0,null,0.0],["ctl","avg3_215","a",null,null,null,null,null,1.0,null,"OutSine",0.7],["head","13:40, Venatio Month 8th, Gold District in Philae, Executive Office"],["bgm","m2"],["m